  Try throwing daggers early and often.  You'll be surprised.  As for a
combat-wombat wizard, if you're human Str:18/** gives +6 damage.
Non-humans need to get GoP for Str:25.  (Not all posters seem to be
aware of this.)  Enchant Magicbane to +7 and it will average 13.40
damage.  (That's +4.4 damage bonus vs plain dagger.  That's better than
most reliable artifact weapons.  Artifacts like Frost Brand, Fire Brand,
etc. have unreliable effects.)

  So +6 str bonus  +13.40 +2 skill bonus gives +21.40 average per hit.

  Note that if you throw daggers at Expert each +0 dagger will average
+2 base +6 Str +2 Expert = +10.  Double that since you'll average two
daggers per throw.  That's +20 damage up to range 9.   Enchant the
daggers and you'll average double the extra damage.  At +7 that's
+2 base +7 enchant + 6 Str +2 Expert = +17 per dagger, doubled to +34
with average two daggers per fling.  That's better than +7 Grayswandir,
and at range.



